\alttext(An increasing and a decreasing two-point map share the same output set but swap which B value corresponds to each A value.)

> Execute the actual two-skip generator and unconditional critic architectures

Each G is the native two-level U-Net: SAME4x4/stride2 ReLU1->4->8, learned
transpose4x4/stride2 ReLU8->4, concat(up14,down14), learned transpose8->2,
concat(up28,source),3x3 sigmoid3->1. All conv kernels are biased normal(.02),
with zero biases. Source seeds6203/6211 own separate1390-value stores, ten tensors
each. The repeated G calls in a cycle reuse their corresponding store.

The executed G_ab trace retains both inputs of both skip concatenations. Spatial
and channel glyphs use shared linear scales, a two-pixel visibility floor and at
most six sampled planes; labels keep exact shapes. G_ba has the same geometry
with independent weights. These traces are shape probes, not extra fits.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/cycle_generator_architecture.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  n::ParameterStore p(6203);
  n::Module         model(
      [&](const n::Tensor& source) {
        auto out = n::models::Pix2PixGenerate(p, source);
        n::model_stage("Down4x4/2 ReLU1→4", source, out.down14);
        n::model_stage("Down4x4/2 ReLU4→8", out.down14, out.down7);
        n::model_stage("Transpose4x4/2 ReLU8→4", out.down7, out.up14);
        n::model_stage(
            "Concat up14,down14", std::vector<n::Tensor>{out.up14, out.down14}, out.joined14);
        n::model_stage("Transpose4x4/2 ReLU8→2", out.joined14, out.up28);
        n::model_stage(
            "Concat up28,source", std::vector<n::Tensor>{out.up28, source}, out.joined28);
        return n::model_stage("Conv3x3/1 sigmoid3→1", out.joined28, out.image);
      },
      "CycleGAN G_ab: two actual skips, reused within cycles");
  n::ModelPlotOptions options;
  options.style                 = n::ModelPlotStyle::Flow;
  options.detail                = n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;
  options.sizing.spatial_scale  = n::ModelPlotScale::Linear;
  options.sizing.channel_scale  = n::ModelPlotScale::Linear;
  options.sizing.minimum_extent = 2;
  options.sizing.max_planes     = 6;
  auto figure                   = model.plot(n::ones({1, 28, 28, 1}), options);
  if (figure.parameter_count() != 1390 || p.size() != 10)
    throw std::runtime_error("executed G census");
  figure.save_svg("build/cycle_generator_architecture.svg");
}
```
// result_begin: markdown
\image(figures/cycle_generator_architecture.svg)
// result_end
\caption(The source-only G_ab trace uses seed6203 and all1390 values. The canonical Pix2PixGenerate function supplies the same reusable architecture for each direction.)
\alttext(An executed28-to14-to7-to14-to28 generator graph retains its encoder skip and direct source skip, including their two separate inputs.)

Each D accepts one image alone, without a condition concatenation. Two biased
SAME4x4/stride2 maps1->4->8, each followed by LeakyReLU(.2), feed a biased3x3
raw8->1 map. Every image has49 overlapping patch logits with nominal18x18
receptive fields, including zero padding near borders. Seeds6217/6221 create
661 values in six tensors each; there is no sigmoid or batch-dependent state.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/cycle_critic_architecture.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  n::ParameterStore p(6217);
  n::Module         model(
      [&](const n::Tensor& image) { return n::models::CycleGanDiscriminate(p, image); },
      "CycleGAN D_a: unconditional local raw patch scores");
  n::ModelPlotOptions options;
  options.style                 = n::ModelPlotStyle::Flow;
  options.detail                = n::ModelPlotDetail::Layers;
  options.sizing.spatial_scale  = n::ModelPlotScale::Linear;
  options.sizing.channel_scale  = n::ModelPlotScale::Linear;
  options.sizing.minimum_extent = 2;
  options.sizing.max_planes     = 6;
  auto figure                   = model.plot(n::ones({1, 28, 28, 1}), options);
  if (figure.parameter_count() != 661 || p.size() != 6)
    throw std::runtime_error("unconditional critic census");
  figure.save_svg("build/cycle_critic_architecture.svg");
}
```
