> Preserve both original galleries and their limited class coverage

Each original gallery shows the first ten held-out rows of its source domain;
these are all label0 in the class-ordered pool. Columns are source,translation,
round trip and known diagnostic target. Those known targets do not enter fitting.
The PNG bytes below match the original files. The translations are weak and gray,
and the round trips do not recover the source digits accurately.

