> State the verified computation and its limits

The independent checker verifies202388 native parameter partials(maximum3.02e-6),
4076881 forward values(maximum1.09e-6),86 representative final scalar differences,
all192 Adam transitions bit exactly and every phase's unselected owners. All1500
unpaired row pairs, all source domain pixels/disjoint IDs, exact original_B
known targets and all validation/final-test scalar records are checked. Native
delegation and this complete report preserve all original artifacts and all347
additional checkpoints exactly. Four optimizer counters finish at48.

The run's final test cycles remain large:.458553344/.469415665, with identity
L1=.471133351/.465910286. Its galleries show weak translations. Neither a valid
joint snapshot nor a finite cycle objective establishes convergence, class
preservation or identification of the chosen rotation/inversion. The complete
editable program, original and broader galleries, wrong-schedule control and
fitting-only references keep those limits inspectable together.
